stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> UNUSED
    UNUSED --> RUNNABLE: allocproc / load
    RUNNABLE --> RUNNING: scheduler selects
    RUNNING --> RUNNABLE: yield / preempt
    RUNNING --> SLEEPING: sleep(chan, lk)
    SLEEPING --> RUNNABLE: wakeup / kill
    RUNNING --> ZOMBIE: exit(status)
    ZOMBIE --> UNUSED: parent wait reclaims
    note right of SLEEPING
      p->lock held while state and chan change
      condition lock is reacquired after wakeup
    end note
